{"4483140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Big Theft Valkeala 3 Revenge", "steam_appid": 4483140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third part of this open world action game series and GTA parody series. Now Terentius Duval is dead and his wife Mary Duval need to go Valkeala called place and collect money bags and finish few missions. Mary Duval has lot of weapons to use and his main mission is find guy who gives you 3 missions. This guy is marked to minimap with M letter. He has 3 missions: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Kill 4 important people in Valkeala town, Those guys are market to minimap. Mary has only limited time to do that, after that second mission is unlocked and seen in minimap and after achieved second mission,  third and last mission is also unlocked. If Mary Duval is killed during 3 missions or hit by car She is wasted and need restart game and make again all 3 missions. So Mary need to be fast and accurate to shooting right targets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Mary Duval has 3 main missions and after that She has several side missions like collecting money bags which are hidden different places in open world. Money bags gives player steam achievements. Mary can also collect money by finishing missions or shooting npc guys in Valkeala place. With money She can buy cars and weapons. Mary can also steal cars which are parked. So can you play as woman hero Mary Duval in this greatest GTA parody and finish all missions and collect all money bags</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 hidden money bags</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several missions in GTA style:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Kill 4 people under limited time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Find Destroyed tank under limited time</p><p class=\"bb_paragra